_:n6bd376b89bb34fda9b4be843fd7c64c6b5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A PredicateMap element to generate the predicate component of the \n        (predicate, object) pair from a logical table row or iterator.\n        " .
_:n719eaf551bfc431e985d06d2196b3f43b18 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:n719eaf551bfc431e985d06d2196b3f43b10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/subject> .
_:nd401eab55eaa4a688fa08e91aa6679dfb7 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Defines the behavior when the collection is empty. True will generate\n        a rdf:nil for a RDF collection or a resource with no members for an RDF\n        container. False will not generate any collection or container.\n        Default is false.\n        " .
_:Nc160bdf65b1149e98bfd825fcb567abd <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:nbadeeac9659d4db6a6ac0bea99e0ed65b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
