_:n013feb54ad554649aa22fd843cae694db7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n013feb54ad554649aa22fd843cae694db8 .
_:n5624b2be696348be9fb43fd10b894bd4b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/inputValue> .
_:nb79b81a29b6141c7a8ddfdc2f00cb458b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:serialization must be an IRI from the W3C formats namespace,\n        and may be provided at most once.\n        " .
_:ne3c74aada7614cb1aafb5c9495fd7ad6b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:function must be an IRI.\n        " .
_:n5624b2be696348be9fb43fd10b894bd4b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents an Object Map.\n    " .
_:nbc5c37b4f2574acabb63849d710f0e89b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/datatype> .
_:n5624b2be696348be9fb43fd10b894bd4b12 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/inputValue> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLRefObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RefObjectMap" .
_:n547653b165f7484788ff634667648052b3 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A template (format string) to specify how to generate a value for a \n        subject, predicate, or object, using one or more columns from a logical\n        table row or iterator.\n        " .
_:N575192f9e6a147c695f5d7afefa541b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:n52b8218ae3f2408b8bed22aec59f6017b5 .
