_:n6d5c03eded3d4307811cb1753c8324fab5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:n6d5c03eded3d4307811cb1753c8324fab6 .
_:n3b64b6c563f14f8daddda50aa557ca35b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/iterator> .
