_:n6bd376b89bb34fda9b4be843fd7c64c6b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Either an rml:object or rml:objectMap must be provided, not multiple\n        " .
_:n3b64b6c563f14f8daddda50aa557ca35b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        rml:iterator specifies the iterator to iterate over\r\n        the data source, and may be provided at most once.\r\n        " .
_:n3b64b6c563f14f8daddda50aa557ca35b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n6bd376b89bb34fda9b4be843fd7c64c6b16 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:object must be an IRI and be provided once.\n        " .
_:ne3c74aada7614cb1aafb5c9495fd7ad6b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:ne3c74aada7614cb1aafb5c9495fd7ad6b4 .
