_:nb79b81a29b6141c7a8ddfdc2f00cb458b3 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A Term Map MAY contain one or more rml:logicalTarget properties to\n        export all triples containing the generated term to different\n        targets.\n        " .
_:n6d5c03eded3d4307811cb1753c8324fab2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rml:encoding" .
_:Ncbb3347688494fa4a70399f29e629774 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:n719eaf551bfc431e985d06d2196b3f43b19 .
_:n6bd376b89bb34fda9b4be843fd7c64c6b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:n6bd376b89bb34fda9b4be843fd7c64c6b3 .
_:n6bd376b89bb34fda9b4be843fd7c64c6b11 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        An ObjectMap element to generate the object component of the \n        (predicate, object) pair from a logical table row or iterator.\n        " .
_:n501f93f3c69a406cbe548339699af654b13 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:n2ad44d1966054033bb192929288862e1b19 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:n2ad44d1966054033bb192929288862e1b9 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLFunctionExecutionShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:ne3c74aada7614cb1aafb5c9495fd7ad6b7 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLDatatypeMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DatatypeMap" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLFunctionMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Function Map.\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractLogicalSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    rml:AbstractLogicalSource must specify how to generate logical iterations on a data source for a triples map.\r\n    " .
_:n3b64b6c563f14f8daddda50aa557ca35b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        The reference formulation (rml:referenceFormulation) defines how to\r\n        reference to elements of the data of the input source.\r\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSubjectMapORPredicateObjectMapShape> .
_:n5624b2be696348be9fb43fd10b894bd4b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Exactly one rml:parameter or rml:parameterMap is required.\n        " .
_:n013feb54ad554649aa22fd843cae694db11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/functionExecution> .
_:n719eaf551bfc431e985d06d2196b3f43b7 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "subjectMap/subject" .
