_:n3b64b6c563f14f8daddda50aa557ca35b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLReferenceFormulationShape> .
_:nbc5c37b4f2574acabb63849d710f0e89b8 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "datatypeMap" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Predicate Object Map.\n    " .
_:n6bd376b89bb34fda9b4be843fd7c64c6b15 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:n6bd376b89bb34fda9b4be843fd7c64c6b13 .
_:n719eaf551bfc431e985d06d2196b3f43b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:n719eaf551bfc431e985d06d2196b3f43b2 .
_:nc5b590320bcb4b9ebd8650f47c0ded7eb5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/parentMap> .
_:Nadb29841f63c4e30a5c57192736975cb <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/subjectMap> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalTargetShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:nb79b81a29b6141c7a8ddfdc2f00cb458b2 .
_:n501f93f3c69a406cbe548339699af654b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n501f93f3c69a406cbe548339699af654b3 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTargetShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    RML Target accepts one rml:compression, and one rml:encoding.\n    All of them are optional.\n    " .
_:n719eaf551bfc431e985d06d2196b3f43b14 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:baseIRI must be an IRI.\n        " .
_:nbc5c37b4f2574acabb63849d710f0e89b7 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specified the language map for the object component for the \n        generated RDF triples.\n        " .
_:n013feb54ad554649aa22fd843cae694db17 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Constant expression shortcut of rml:returnMap.\n        " .
_:n719eaf551bfc431e985d06d2196b3f43b11 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "subjectMap" .
_:n51d8a83b03ea414784befb6a9ad1f2ffb4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/WriteRead> .
_:n547653b165f7484788ff634667648052b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:template must be a string with well-formed brace delimiters:\n        every unescaped '{' must be closed by an unescaped '}' with no\n        unescaped braces in between, and every literal '{', '}', or '\\'\n        (both inside and outside reference expressions) must be\n        backslash-escaped.\n        " .
_:n6bd376b89bb34fda9b4be843fd7c64c6b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:objectMap must be an IRI or blank node and be provided once.\n        " .
_:n013feb54ad554649aa22fd843cae694db6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/returnMap> .
_:nf17c259fb7ee4eae9acc3dc43f608937b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLJoinShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:Join must specify exactly one rml:parent/rml:parentMap \n    and rml:child/rml:childMap.\n    " .
_:n501f93f3c69a406cbe548339699af654b15 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTriplesMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n719eaf551bfc431e985d06d2196b3f43b14 .
