_:n6bd376b89bb34fda9b4be843fd7c64c6b16 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the object for the generated RDF triples.\n        " .
_:n013feb54ad554649aa22fd843cae694db16 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLReturnMapShape> .
_:n501f93f3c69a406cbe548339699af654b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        An IRI indicating whether a generated term should be an IRI,\n        Blank Node, or a Literal.\n        " .
