_:nd401eab55eaa4a688fa08e91aa6679dfb8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        one or more rml:gather properties are needed, each pointing to a\n        RML Term Map.\n        " .
_:n2ad44d1966054033bb192929288862e1b15 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n2ad44d1966054033bb192929288862e1b16 .
