_:n719eaf551bfc431e985d06d2196b3f43b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Exactly one rml:logicalSource is required to access the data source.\n        " .
_:n6d5c03eded3d4307811cb1753c8324fab6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/root> .
_:n6bd376b89bb34fda9b4be843fd7c64c6b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/predicateMap> .
_:n5624b2be696348be9fb43fd10b894bd4b11 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Values of the parameters.\n        " .
_:nb79b81a29b6141c7a8ddfdc2f00cb458b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The target (rml:target) locates the output target. It is a URI\n        that represents the target where it must export generated RDF triples\n        to.\n        " .
_:nbadeeac9659d4db6a6ac0bea99e0ed65b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:source must be provided as a string Literal.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSourceTargetShape> .
